  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 119 * 7 * 63 * 24 * 3 * 8\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) ÷, +, -, ×, =**\n\nGiven: 119 * 7 * 63 * 24 * 3 * 8\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**119 ÷ 7**__ + 63 - 24 × 3 = 8\n\n⇒ 17 + 63 - __**24 × 3**__ = 8\n\n⇒ __**17 + 63**__ - 72 = 8\n\n⇒ __80 - 72__ = 8\n\n**⇒ 8 = 8**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) -, +, ÷, ×, =\n\nGiven: 119 * 7 * 63 * 24 * 3 * 8\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 119 - 7 + __**63 ÷ 24**__ × 3 = 8\n\n⇒ __**119**__ - 7 __**+ 7.875**__ = 8\n\n⇒ __**126.875 - 7**__ = 8\n\n⇒ 119.875 ≠ 8\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) +, ÷, ×, -, =\n\nGiven: 119 * 7 * 63 * 24 * 3 * 8\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 119 + __**7 ÷ 63**__ × 24 - 3 = 8\n\n⇒ 119 + __**0.11 × 24**__ - 3 = 8\n\n⇒ __**119 + 2.64**__ - 3 = 8\n\n⇒ __121.64 - 3__ = 8\n\n⇒ 118.64 ≠ 8\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) +, ÷, -, ×, =\n\nGiven: 119 * 7 * 63 * 24 * 3 * 8\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 119 + __**7 ÷ 63**__ - 24 × 3 = 8\n\n⇒ 119 + 0.11 - __**24 × 3**__ = 8\n\n⇒ __**119 + 0.11**__ - 72 = 8\n\n⇒ __119.11____** - 72**__ = 8\n\n⇒ 47.11 ≠ 8\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
